  "faqRechargeWallet": "Main apna wallet kaise recharge karun?",
  "faqRechargeWalletAnswer": "Profile menu se Wallet kholo, Flat Recharge ya Reseller options choose karo. Package select karo aur Google Play se payment complete karo.",
  "faqSendMessages": "Main messages kaise send karun?",
  "faqSendMessagesAnswer": "User search karo, unki profile kholo, aur Message button tap karo. Profile mein Messages menu se sabhi chats access kar sakte ho.",
