  "securePayments": "• Secure payments",
  "privacyPolicyContent": "Privacy Policy – Chamakz\n\n1. APPLICATION SCOPE OF THIS PRIVACY POLICY\n\nChamakz use karke aap agree karte ho ki hum aapki information ko is Privacy Policy ke according access, collect, store, use, aur share kar sakte hain. Agar aap is Privacy Policy se agree nahi karte to please Chamakz use na kare.\n\nYeh Privacy Policy Chamakz Terms of Service ka hissa hai. Yahan use hue terms ka matlab Terms of Service mein defined terms jaisa hi hai.\n\nHum kabhi kabhi is Privacy Policy ko update ya revise kar sakte hain. Agar important changes hui to hum app, website, ya email se aapko inform karenge. Changes effective hone ke baad Chamakz use karte rahne se aap updated policy se agree karte ho.\n\nChamakz mein third-party websites ya services ke links ho sakte hain. Yeh Privacy Policy third-party services par apply nahi hoti. Hum third parties ke information use karne ke tarike ke liye responsible nahi hain.\n\n2. INFORMATION YOU PROVIDE AND WE COLLECT\n\nChamakz services provide karne ke liye hum ye information access, collect, store, aur use kar sakte hain:\n\n2.1 Information Jo Aap Chamakz Use Karte Waqt Dete Ho\n\nAccount Information:\n• Name, gender, date of birth, age, city/area, profile photo, social media account information, aur koi bhi tags ya details jo aap add karte ho.\n\nProfile Information (jo dusre users ko dikhti hai):\n• Photos, gender, city/area, aur koi bhi content jo aap upload karte ho.\n\nUsage Information:\n• Device aur connection details\n• IP address\n• Device capability, bandwidth\n• Page views aur interaction statistics\n• Network type\n• Geographical usage data\n\nTechnical Information:\n• Mobile carrier\n• IP address\n• Location/country/region/time zone\n• Device version & identification number\n• Operating system\n• App settings\n• Likes, dislikes, aur in-app interactions\n\n2.2 Sensitive Personal Information\n\nKuch features enable karne ke liye (jaise live streaming, video calling), hum access request kar sakte hain:\n• Microphone – calls ke dauran audio input ke liye.\n• Camera – profile photos aur real-time video ke liye.\n• Location – personalized content ke liye aapka region dikhane ke liye.\n\nHum inhe sirf aapki explicit permission ke saath access karte hain.\n\nAapki consent ke bina hum sensitive personal information marketing ke liye use nahi karte.\n\n2.3 Children's Information\n\nChamakz 18 saal se kam umar ke users ke liye intended nahi hai. Hum knowingly 18 se kam umar ke kisi se personal data collect nahi karte. Agar aisi data milti hai to hum immediately delete kar denge.\n\n3. HOW WE USE YOUR INFORMATION\n\nHum aapki information ko in purposes ke liye use kar sakte hain:\n• Chamakz services provide aur operate karne ke liye (current aur future features).\n• App experience improve aur personalize karne ke liye, content recommendations ke saath.\n• Inquiries respond karne aur customer support provide karne ke liye.\n• Usage trends aur app performance analyze karne ke liye.\n• Safety maintain karne aur misuse prevent karne ke liye.\n• Identity verify karne aur fraud/illegal activity prevent karne ke liye.\n• Terms of Service aur policies enforce karne ke liye.\n\nChamakz mein jo messages, photos, videos, ya content aap share karte ho wo hamare servers par store ho sakta hai. Agar aap unhe publicly ya dusre users ke sath share karte ho to distributed hone ke baad unhe remove karna mushkil ho sakta hai.\n\n3.2 Transfer & Storage of Information\n\nHamare servers multiple countries mein operate kar sakte hain. Aapki information aapke jurisdiction se bahar store ya process ho sakti hai.\n\nChamakz use karke aap is data transfer se consent dete ho.\n\n3.3 Sharing of Information\n\nA. Chamakz Ke Andar Sharing\n• Public profile information kisi bhi user ko dikhti hai.\n• Aapka online status ya activity dusron ko dikh sakti hai.\n\nB. Third-Party Partners Ke Sath Sharing\n\nAap agree karte ho ki hum aapki information share kar sakte hain:\n\nAnalytics Partners:\nResearch aur performance analysis ke liye aggregated ya anonymous form mein share.\n\nService Providers:\nCompanies jo hamari services operate karne mein help karti hain (hosting, analytics, communication tools). Wo sirf hamari taraf se tasks perform karne ke liye aapka data access kar sakti hain.\n\nLaw Enforcement:\nAgar law, legal processes, ya users ya platform protect karne ke liye required ho.\n\nNew Owners (Business Transfer):\nAgar Chamakz acquire, merge, ya reorganize ho jaye to aapka data new operator ko transfer ho sakta hai.\n\nHum kabhi bhi personal information third parties ko bechte nahi hain.\n\n3.4 Security Measures\n\nAapka data protect karne ke liye hum administrative, technical, aur physical safeguards use karte hain. Lekin koi system 100% secure nahi hota. Agar data breach ho to hum law ke according aapko inform karenge.\n\nThird parties ke sath information share karte waqt hum ensure karte hain ki wo confidentiality aur security obligations follow karein.\n\n4. ACCESSING & MANAGING YOUR INFORMATION\n\nAap kabhi bhi apni profile access aur edit kar sakte ho.\n\nAgar aapko lagta hai ki Chamakz profile ki information galat hai to aap humse contact karke correction request kar sakte ho.\n\nAgar aap account delete karte ho:\n• Aapko apne data, messages, aur history ki access nahi milegi.\n• Kuch content visible rahe sakti hai agar wo dusre users ke sath share ki gayi ho.\n• Law ke according required data hum retain kar sakte hain (fraud prevention, disputes, legal compliance).\n\nTechnically impossible ya legally restricted requests fulfill nahi ho sakti.\n\n5. CONTACT US\n\nAgar Privacy Policy ya privacy matters ke baare mein questions hain to aap humse contact kar sakte hain:\n\n📩 Email: info@chamakz.app",
  "termsConditionsContent": "Chamak Live use karke aap in terms aur conditions se agree karte ho.\n\n1. Account Registration\n2. User Conduct\n3. Content Guidelines\n4. Payment Terms\n5. Termination\n\nLast updated: January 2025",
